| mock-rule-14-asynchronous-tag-flooding-search-poisoning.ts:11:9:11:59 | joplin. ... pam' }) | Resource Exhaustion (Flooding): The plugin is rapidly creating tags, notes, or resources inside an unbounded background interval or synchronous loop. \\n**Reviewer Action:** This can destroy Joplin's search index and exhaust storage quotas. Confirm the loop is strictly bounded by a finite limit (e.g., iterating only over user-selected notes) and is not infinite. |
